   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"DE\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Dear listfolk,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">when trying to run an mcds model in R, which has been working for many times, I now get this weird error message<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Error in ddf.ds(model = dsmodel, data, meta.data = meta.data, control = control,  :\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">  <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Some values of object field are duplicates. They must be unique.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">I‘ve made sure that object is unique, and required variables exist. I suspect the real issue is the size of my dataset with 31973822 obs. Is tehre some\r\n upper limit to the amount of data which can be handled. <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Thanks in advance<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Regards<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Jochen\r\n</span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "plmh-RLoDgAJ",
   "from": "Eric Rexstad",
   "author": "f2122b34f1aa6e95",
