   "subject": "Re: [distance-sampling] Error message - limit to size of input data?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Jochen</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>I&#39;m afraid I don&#39;t know the answer to your question; we&#39;ve not tested our code with &gt;30 million observations.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>The line of code that produces the message you report does something like this</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<code>\r\n<pre style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.05);padding:0.2em 1em\">&gt; x &lt;- seq(from=1, to=31973822)\r\n<br>&gt; tail(x)\r\n<br>[1] 31973817 31973818 31973819 31973820 31973821 31973822\r\n<br>&gt; length(x)\r\n<br>[1] 31973822\r\n<br>&gt; length(unique(x))\r\n<br>[1] 31973822\r\n<br>&gt; length(x) == length(unique(x))\r\n<br>[1] TRUE</pre>\r\n</code><br>\r\n<div>As you can see R itself can cope with values of that magnitude, so I don&#39;t have evidence this is the source of your problem.  Are you providing\r\n<code>ds()</code>  with a flatfile, such that the <code>object</code>  field is added within the code, or have you provided the\r\n<code>object</code>  field yourself?  I ask because I&#39;m taking the error message at face value, suggesting there might be something amiss with the\r\n<code>object</code> field.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><u></u>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top\"></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<div>Eric Rexstad</div>\r\n<div>Senior Research Fellow, CREEM, Univ. of St Andrews, Charity SC013532</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9em;border-top:1px solid gray;min-width:250px;max-width:300px;margin-top:4px;padding-top:4px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eric.r...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"margin-right:8px\"><a href=\"tel:+44%20(0)1334%20461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a></span></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=The%20Observatory%2C%20Buchanan%20Gardens%2C%20St%20Andrews%20KY16%209LZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://maps.google.com/?q%3DThe%2520Observatory%252C%2520Buchanan%2520Gardens%252C%2520St%2520Andrews%2520KY16%25209LZ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473813710000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Lfcpy4GsGeHWClj5lgy2a\">The Observatory, Buchanan Gardens, St Andrews KY16 9LZ</a></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://erex.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://erex.github.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473813710000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0FiV4KLQ8uU8hP6t_fAjEZ\">http://erex.github.io</a></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<u></u></div></div>"
